[I] ALSA sequencer to JACK MIDI bridging

[T] a2jmidid is a daemon that bridges ALSA sequencer ports to JACK MIDI,
[T] easing the use of legacy, non JACK-ified MIDI applications in a JACK
[T] system. It supports automatic bridging, creating a JACK MIDI port for
[T] every ALSA sequencer port, as well as static unidirectional bridges.

[U] https://codeberg.org/LADI/a2jmidid

[A] A2jmidid Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

